  "description": "Custom character statistics for SetNet: define your own stat schema (attack power, defense, move/attack speed, …) and give any entity — players or mobs — a StatSet whose values are computed from a base plus flat / additive-percent / multiplicative-percent modifiers (clamped, cached, remove-by-source). The foundation SetNet.Combat, SetNet.Abilities and SetNet.Equipment build on. Server-side, no wire protocol. Depends only on SetNet.",
